# text = Spruce , who had earned his title of Captain on the plains of Newmarket , which had witnessed for many a year his successful exploits , had a weakness for the aristocracy , who knowing his graceful infirmity patronized him with condescending dexterity , acknowledged his existence in Pall Mall as well as at Tattersalls , and thus occasionally got a point more than the betting out of him .
