# text = It disappointed great hopes , it baffled great plans , and dispelled for a season the conviction that , it is believed , had been long maturing in his grace's mind ; that he was the man of the age , that his military career had been only a preparation for a civil course not less illustrious ; and that it was reserved for him to control for the rest of his life undisputed the destinies of a country , which was indebted to him in no slight degree for its European pre-eminence .
