# text = With the water streaming down the walls , the light distinguished through the roof , with no hearth even in winter , the virtuous mother in the sacred pangs of childbirth , gives forth another victim to our thoughtless civilization ; surrounded by three generations whose inevitable presence is more painful than her sufferings in that hour of travail ; while the father of her coming child , in another corner of the sordid chamber , lies stricken by that typhus which his contaminating dwelling has breathed into his veins , and for whose next prey is perhaps destined , his new-born child .
