# text = Their re-entrance into the surrounding parishes was viewed with great suspicion ; their renewed settlement opposed by every ingenious contrivance ; those who availed themselves of their labour were careful that they should not become dwellers on the soil ; and though , from the excessive competition , there were few districts in the kingdom where the rate of wages was more depressed , those who were fortunate enough to obtain the scant remuneration , had , in addition to their toil , to endure each morn and even a weary journey before they could reach the scene of their labour , or return to the squalid hovel which profaned the name of home .
