# text = Fever , in every form , pale Consumption , exhausting Synochus , and trembling Ague ,-- returned after cultivating the broad fields of merry England the bold British peasant , returned to encounter the worst of diseases with a frame the least qualified to oppose them ; a frame that subdued by toil was never sustained by animal food ; drenched by the tempest could not change its dripping rags ; and was indebted for its scanty fuel to the windfalls of the woods .
