# text = But it was in the centre of this tract of ruins , occupying a space of not less than two acres , that , with a strength that had defied time , and with a beauty that had at last turned away the wrath of man , still rose if not in perfect , yet admirable , form and state , one of the noblest achievements of Christian art ,-- the Abbey church .
