# text = But she was very clever , very indeed , something quite extraordinary said Lady Marney said Egremont said Lady Marney , with a sort of sigh , and shaking her head Soon the dear little Poinsett was singing , much gratified by being invited to the instrument by Mr Egremont , who for a few minutes hung over her , and then evidently under the influence of her tones , walked up and down the room , and only speaking to beg that she would continue her charming performances .
