# text = The companions entered the spacious premises ; and making their way to the crowded bar , Stephen , with a glance serious but which indicated intimacy , caught the eye of a comely lady , who presided over the mysteries , and said in a low voice Stephen whispered to Gerard and after a moment's pause , he asked the fair president for a couple of tickets for each of which he paid threepence ; a sum however , according to the printed declaration of the voucher , convertible into potential liquid refreshments , no great compensation to a very strict member of the Temperance Society of Mowbray .
