# text = Taper looked grave at this connection between Tadpole and Lady Firebrace ; and whenever an election was lost , or a division stuck in the mud , he gave the cue with a nod and a monosyllable , and the conservative pack that infests clubs , chattering on subjects of which it is impossible they can know anything , instantly began barking and yelping , denouncing traitors , and wondering how the leaders could be so led by the nose , and not see that which was flagrant to the whole world .
