# text = We have removed woman from her sphere ; we may have reduced wages by her introduction into the market of labour ; but under these circumstances what we call domestic life is a condition impossible to be realized for the people of this country ; and we must not therefore be surprised that they seek solace or rather refuge in the beer-shop .
