# text = Far as the eye could reach , and the region was level , except where a range of limestone hills formed its distant limit , a wilderness of cottages or tenements that were hardly entitled to a higher name , were scattered for many miles over the land ; some detached , some connected in little rows , some clustering in groups , yet rarely forming continuous streets , but interspersed with blazing furnaces , heaps of burning coal , and piles of smouldering ironstone ; while forges and engine chimneys roared and puffed in all directions , and indicated the frequent presence of the mouth of the mine and the bank of the coal-pit .
