# text = On each side of their master , seated on a stool higher than the rest , was an urchin of not more than four or five years of age , serious and demure , and as if proud of his eminent position , or working incessantly at his little file ;-- these were two sons of the bishop said the bishop , in a hoarse , harsh voice and he sprang forward and seized the luckless ears of the first apprentice he could get hold off , and wrung them till the blood spouted forth sang out the boy said the bishop , looking round , and he caught the figure of Morley who had just entered the shop said Morley said the bishop said Morley said Morley said the bishop said Morley said Hatton , eagerly said Morley .
