# text = And now Egremont is paying one of his almost daily visits to his mother at Deloraine House said Lady Marney said Egremont said Lady Marney with a smile said Egremont smiling and looking round said Lady Marney , and she looked round the blue satin walls of her apartment , covered with cabinet pictures of exquisite art , and then at her tables crowded with precious and fantastic toys said Egremont and she pointed to an almost matchless specimen of old Sevres porcelain said Egremont said Lady Marney said Egremont , and he pointed to the portrait of a saint by Allori : the face of a beautiful young girl , radiant and yet solemn , with rich tresses of golden brown hair , and large eyes dark as night , fringed with ebon lashes that hung upon the glowing cheek said Egremont musingly said Lady Marney said Egremont said his mother send to Brookes's .
