# text = Even now in the quiet times in which we live , when public robbery is out of fashion and takes the milder title of a commission of inquiry , and when there is no treason except voting against a Minister , who , though he may have changed all the policy which you have been elected to support , expects your vote and confidence all the same ; even in this age of mean passions and petty risks , it is something to step aside from Palace Yard and instead of listening to a dull debate , where the facts are only a repetition of the blue books you have already read , and the fancy an ingenious appeal to the recrimination of Hansard , to enter the old abbey and listen to an anthem !
