# text = The area round it , which was sufficiently ample , was formed by buildings , generally of a very mean character : the long back premises of a carpenter , the straggling yard of a hackney-man : sometimes a small , narrow isolated private residence , like a waterspout in which a rat might reside : sometimes a group of houses of more pretension .
