# text = Mr Hatton was buried for a few moments in a reverie , during which he played with the tail of the Persian cat We left Sybil and Egremont just at the moment that Gerard arrived at the very threshold which they had themselves reached exclaimed Sybil , and then with a faint blush of which she was perhaps unconscious , she added , as if apprehensive Gerard would not recall his old companion said Gerard embarrassed , while Egremont himself changed colour and was infinitely confused .
