# text = And now he seemed wrapt in the very paradise of some creative vision ; still he filled the glass , but this time he only sipped it , as if he were afraid to disturb the clustering images around him On the evening of the day that Egremont had met Sybil in the Abbey of Westminster , and subsequently parted from her under circumstances so distressing , the Countess of Marney held a great assembly at the family mansion in St James " Square , which Lord Marney had intended to have let to a new club , and himself and his family to have taken refuge for a short season at an hotel , but he drove so hard a bargain that before the lease was signed , the new club , which mainly consisted of an ingenious individual who had created himself secretary , had vanished .
