# text = In her nervous excitement she credited all these catastrophes ; seized upon " the Duke " in order that Lady Deloraine might not gain his ear , and resolved to get home as soon as possible , in order that she might write without a moment's loss of time to Sir Robert said Sir Vavasour Firebrace to Mr Jermyn said Mr Ormsby said Mr Berners said Lord Fitz-Heron said Mr Ormsby said Lord Marney to his mother , as he rose from the sofa where he had been some time in conversation with her said Lady Deloraine said Lady Deloraine said a great whig dame to Mr Egerton , one of her own party he said said the whig dame said Mr Egerton said the whig dame smiling with fascination said Mr Egerton said Mr Tadpole and the Duke has recommended her Majesty to send for Sir Robert said Mr Taper said Mr Taper said Mr Tadpole said Mr Taper said Mr Tadpole said Mr Taper said Mr Tadpole said Mr Taper said Mr Tadpole said Taper said Mr Tadpole continued Mr Tadpole as he stopped before the house of the Duke of Fitz-Aquitaine The Duke of Fitz-Aquitaine wanted Ireland and Lord de Mowbray wanted the Garter .
