# text = In the first instance , not a member was absent from his place ; men were brought indeed from distant capitals to participate in the struggle and to decide it ; the debate lasted for days , almost for weeks ; not a public man of light and leading in the country withheld the expression of his opinion ; the fate of governments was involved in it ; cabinets were overthrown and reconstructed in the throes and tumult of the strife , and for the first time for a long period the Sovereign personally interposed in public transactions with a significance of character , which made the working classes almost believe that the privileged had at last found a master , and the unfranchished regained their natural chief .
