# text = Morley trembled ; and then in a hurried and agitated voice , said said Morley , slowly , rising from his seat and pacing the room , and speaking in a low calm voice said Sybil very pale , speaking almost in a whisper and with her gaze fixed intently on her companion said Sybil clasping her hands said Morley , springing to her side , in a hoarse voice and with an eye of fire said Sybil , dropping her arms and bending her head in woe said Morley with a sort of stifled laugh said Sybil , throwing herself into a chair said Sybil with dignity said Morley maliciously exclaimed Sybil starting in her chair , her eye flashing lightning , her distended nostril quivering with scorn said Morley said Morley he added in a tone of mournful anguish said Sybil , in a calm tone , and with an expression that denoted she was thinking of other things said Morley , slowly and earnestly , walking to her side , and looking her intently in the face he paused .
