# text = In a paroxysm of nervous excitement she exclaimed All the newspaper readers put down their journals and stared said the waiter , and he left off throwing the sand said one of the guests said Sybil said another guest said Saul said the first guest , as a lean black-looking individual , with grizzled hair and a red nose , entered the coffee-room from the interior whispered one to another said Mr Tanner abruptly said Sybil : and advancing towards him she said in a low voice said Tanner very discourteously and he led the way to the inner room , a small close parlour adorned with portraits of Tom Paine , Cobbett , Thistlewood , and General Jackson ; with a fire , though it was a hot July , and a very fat woman affording still more heat , and who was drinking shrub and water and reading the police reports .
