# text = Sybil extricated herself from the vehicle unhurt ; a group immediately formed round the cab , a knot of young thieves , almost young enough for infant schools , a dustman , a woman nearly naked and very drunk , and two unshorn ruffians with brutality stamped on every feature , with pipes in their mouths , and their hands in their pockets said the cabman said Sybil , taking out her purse said the dustman , in a hoarse voice squeaked a young thief hiccupped the woman said the young thief making a dash at the purse , but he was not quite tall enough , and failed said one of the ruffians taking his pipe out of his mouth and sending a volume of smoke into Sybil's face But at this moment appeared a policeman , one of the permanent garrison of the quarter , who seeing one of her Majesty's carriages in trouble thought he must interfere he said
