# text = And the cabman , who was a good fellow though in too much trouble to aid Sybil , explained in the terse and picturesque language of Cockaigne , doing full justice to his late fare , the whole circumstances said the policeman and taking the woman by her shoulder he gave her a spin that sent her many a good yard he asked gruffly of the lads said the captain of the infant hand putting his thumb to his nose and running away , followed by his troop said her official preserver to Sybil , for she had not thought it wise to confess her ultimate purpose , and indicate under the apprehended circumstances the place of rendezvous to a member of the police Aided by these instructions , Sybil hastened on , avoiding notice as much as was in her power , and assisted in some degree by the advancing gloom of night .
