# text = The ball was in the statue gallery illumined on this night in the Russian fashion , which while it diffused a brilliant light throughout the beautiful chamber , was peculiarly adapted to develope the contour of the marble forms of grace and loveliness that were ranged around enquired Lord Marney of his mother said Lady de Mowbray and here Lady de Mowbray gave a smiling sigh said Mr Berners to Lord Fitzheron said Lady Joan to Mr Mountchesney he murmured said Mr Mountchesney Lady Joan looked at him , and her lip rather curled said Lord Milford to Lord Eugene de Vere said Lord Eugene said Lord Milford said Lord Eugene asked Lady Firebrace of Lady St Julians she replied in a tone of affected despair said Lady Firebrace exclaimed Lady Firebrace said Lady Firebrace , with a look of encouraging mystery said Lady Marney to her husband A dexterous description of one of the most unlicked and unlickable cubs that ever entered society with forty thousand a year ; courted by all , and with just that degree of cunning that made him suspicious of every attention said Lady Marney said Egremont said Lady Marney shaking her head
