# text = She was answered in the affirmative , on condition that the note was previously perused by him she said , and taking up a pen she inscribed these words said Sybil to the inspector in a tone of mournful desolation and of mild sweetness and she extended him the letter , which he read said the inspector with emotion , for the spirit of Sybil had already controlled his nature said Sybil , and she addressed the letter to adding that superscription the sight of which had so agitated Egremont at Deloraine House Night waned : and Sybil was at length slumbering .
