# text = Ale was instantly ordered for the Liberator , who after a copious draught assumed a less menacing air , and smacking his lips , pushed aside the dishes , and sate down on the table swinging his legs said the Chartist Morley slightly advanced , he caught the Liberator's eye , who scrutinized him with extreme earnestness , and then jumping from the table shouted said Morley quietly said the Bishop said Morley said the Bishop The creator and counsellor of peers started in his chair and turned pale .
