# text = One of the men , frequently interrupted by all the women , immediately entered into a narrative of the state of affairs for which the lady was evidently quite unprepared , for her alarm was considerable continued the man said the lady in a kind tone , and who seemed to recognise her exclaimed Sybil said the man , whose companion had now fastened the boat to the bank , and so wishing them good morning , and followed by the whole of his cargo , they went on their way .
