# text = This was not a crisis of corkscrews ; the heads of the bottles were knocked off with the same promptitude and dexterity as if they were shelling nuts or decapitating shrimps : the choicest wines of Christendom were poured down the thirsty throats that ale and spirits had hitherto only stimulated ; Tummas was swallowing Burgundy ; Master Nixon had got hold of a batch of tokay ; while the Bishop himself seated on the ground and leaning against an arch , the long perspective of the cellars full of rapacious figures brandishing bottles and torches , alternately quaffed some very old Port and some Madeira of many voyages , and was making up his mind as to their respective and relative merits .
